  "description": "Works to Gasholder No.2 comprising: (i) bell and tank wall stabilisation works including concrete pours; (ii) the recording of the existing structure, the dismantling and off-site refurbishment and restoration of part of the existing structure, (iii) the permanent removal of roof sheeting, metal tank walls and infilling of existing void, (iv) the incorporation of replacement components where the original components are degraded beyond repair, and (v) the repainting and erection of the restored and replacement components of the gasholder in a new configuration with required alterations to facilitate the use of the salvaged elements of the gasholder as an integrated feature of the wider landscaped park, including introduction of a water feature and new seating and other associated works. (AMENDED DESCRIPTION)",
